{
  "source": "Prompts/know-the-app-1.mp4",
  "duration": 180.0475625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.11,
      "end": 2.85,
      "text": "Taking a picture on your phone is usually straightforward."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.75,
      "end": 5.51,
      "text": "You open the camera app, point, and tap."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.09,
      "end": 9.97,
      "text": "For most snapshots, that default setting gives you exactly what you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.69,
      "end": 13.27,
      "text": "But specific situations require different tools."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.05,
      "end": 17.17,
      "text": "If you are taking a family photo in the dark, you have to turn on the flash."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.95,
      "end": 20.05,
      "text": "If you are sitting high in the stands at a hockey game,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.41,
      "end": 21.81,
      "text": "you need to zoom in to see the players."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.89,
      "end": 25.01,
      "text": "Generative AI apps work the same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.53,
      "end": 27.43,
      "text": "Depending on the app and your subscription level,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.43,
      "end": 29.99,
      "text": "you often have three advanced options available."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.71,
      "end": 32.81,
      "text": "The model, thinking, and research."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.63,
      "end": 35.47,
      "text": "You won't use these options for every prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.95,
      "end": 38.23,
      "text": "But understanding what these settings actually do"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.23,
      "end": 42.33,
      "text": "helps you get a better answer when a task requires more than a simple point and tap."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.09,
      "end": 47.45,
      "text": "Every time you use an AI app, a large language model, or LLM,"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.67,
      "end": 48.59,
      "text": "generates the responses."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.43,
      "end": 52.15,
      "text": "You can think of the LLM as the engine inside the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.69,
      "end": 56.37,
      "text": "When choosing a model, you select which specific LLM engine you want."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.97,
      "end": 58.53,
      "text": "Different models have different capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.63,
      "end": 61.43,
      "text": "This graphic explains model selection."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.45,
      "end": 64.27,
      "text": "The everyday model handles simple tasks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.39,
      "end": 67.43,
      "text": "like asking to suggest a funny movie to watch tonight."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.35,
      "end": 70.87,
      "text": "The more capable model tackles demanding details,"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.31,
      "end": 73.71,
      "text": "for a prompt like help me plan a summer business,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.07,
      "end": 76.87,
      "text": "including costs, pricing, and how many customers I'll need."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.65,
      "end": 78.69,
      "text": "Select the larger model."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.41,
      "end": 80.81,
      "text": "Choosing a model swaps out the engine."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.61,
      "end": 84.67,
      "text": "The thinking setting controls the amount of time that engine spends"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.67,
      "end": 87.35,
      "text": "processing the steps of your prompt before giving an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.31,
      "end": 89.57,
      "text": "Consider writing an English essay."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.37,
      "end": 92.17,
      "text": "Before writing, you plan main points,"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.51,
      "end": 94.19,
      "text": "gather examples, and organize them."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.81,
      "end": 98.17,
      "text": "AI doesn't think like a student, but increasing thinking time"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.17,
      "end": 101.17,
      "text": "instructs the system to run through more internal processing steps"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.17,
      "end": 103.71,
      "text": "and verify its logic before returning the output."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.63,
      "end": 106.25,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down thinking time."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.93,
      "end": 108.45,
      "text": "Less thinking is for routine work,"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.45,
      "end": 110.37,
      "text": "like turning meeting notes into a checklist,"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.93,
      "end": 112.51,
      "text": "where AI spends less time processing."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.41,
      "end": 116.77,
      "text": "More thinking gives time to weigh options and check answers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.81,
      "end": 118.51,
      "text": "useful for deep analysis,"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.03,
      "end": 121.83,
      "text": "like dividing a complex project among four people"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.83,
      "end": 122.87,
      "text": "with conflicting schedules."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.93,
      "end": 127.97,
      "text": "The final setting relates to how much external data the AI pulls in."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.61,
      "end": 130.35,
      "text": "If you stop at a drive-through for a cheeseburger,"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.75,
      "end": 132.99,
      "text": "you already have enough information to place your order."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.75,
      "end": 134.99,
      "text": "Buying a house is different."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.55,
      "end": 137.53,
      "text": "You compare prices, research neighborhoods,"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.87,
      "end": 138.87,
      "text": "and calculate commutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.83,
      "end": 142.05,
      "text": "Regular AI chat looks up basic facts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.53,
      "end": 144.85,
      "text": "but research mode is built for these larger decisions."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.55,
      "end": 148.13,
      "text": "It actively gathers information from multiple websites"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.13,
      "end": 150.83,
      "text": "and brings it together so you can compare your options."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.87,
      "end": 153.77,
      "text": "This graphic shows when to use research tools."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.39,
      "end": 156.37,
      "text": "Regular chat answers direct questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.69,
      "end": 159.05,
      "text": "like driving times from Dallas to UT Austin."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.71,
      "end": 162.89,
      "text": "Deep research compares websites and builds sourced reports,"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.39,
      "end": 166.01,
      "text": "useful when asking the AI to compare physics programs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.41,
      "end": 168.15,
      "text": "admissions requirements and tuition costs"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.15,
      "end": 169.23,
      "text": "between those universities."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.33,
      "end": 172.31,
      "text": "You have three distinct options at your disposal,"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.97,
      "end": 174.61,
      "text": "the model, thinking, and research."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.19,
      "end": 176.57,
      "text": "Use them when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
